	•	Section 4 Comments/Quotes: Regression imputation was used for missing development data. The primary external validation excluded offers with unavailable model inputs, while a sensitivity analysis used fivefold multiple imputation in an expanded validation cohort of 86 offers; therefore, missing-data handling was mixed. Outcome proportions were preserved using five-fold stratified cross-validation, although no resampling or class weighting was reported. Source code was not reported, but the full logistic-regression coefficients and intercept are provided in Table 4 and an online calculator is available. No predictor normalization or standardization procedure was described.

